{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q27108568","formula":"C₁₅H₁₈O₃","hill":"C15H18O3","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":15.0,"H":18.0,"O":3.0},"names":{"en":"Xanthatin"},"descriptions":{"en":"Xanthatin, or (3aR,7S,8aS)-7-methyl-3-methylidene-6-[(E)-3-oxobut-1-enyl]-4,7,8,8a-tetrahydro-3aH-cyclohepta[b]furan-2-one (C15H18O3) is a major bioactive compound found in the leaves of the Xanthium strumarium (Asteracae) plant. It is classified as a natural sesquiterpene lactone. Xanthatin is believed to have anti-inflammatory, anti-tumour, anti-microbial, and anti-parasitic properties hence it is being researched for potential use in treatment of cancer and autoimmune diseases."},"fame":1,"pubchemCid":5281511,"mass":246.3,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@H]1C[C@H]2[C@H](CC=C1/C=C/C(=O)C)C(=C)C(=O)O2","inchikey":"RBRPTFMVULVGIC-ZTIIIDENSA-N","iupac":"(3aR,7S,8aS)-7-methyl-3-methylidene-6-[(E)-3-oxobut-1-enyl]-4,7,8,8a-tetrahydro-3aH-cyclohepta[b]furan-2-one","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"5281511","atoms":36,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":3.129,"y":0.931,"z":-0.924,"el":"O"},{"x":5.111,"y":-0.243,"z":-1.002,"el":"O"},{"x":-5.436,"y":0.481,"z":-0.136,"el":"O"},{"x":1.946,"y":0.831,"z":-0.109,"el":"C"},{"x":1.729,"y":-0.661,"z":0.061,"el":"C"},{"x":0.782,"y":1.536,"z":-0.792,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.494,"y":1.688,"z":0.058,"el":"C"},{"x":0.794,"y":-0.999,"z":1.215,"el":"C"},{"x":3.158,"y":-1.079,"z":0.16,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.213,"y":0.396,"z":0.42,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.653,"y":-0.722,"z":0.921,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.257,"y":2.537,"z":1.315,"el":"C"},{"x":3.956,"y":-0.12,"z":-0.639,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.651,"y":0.423,"z":0.225,"el":"C"},{"x":3.731,"y":-2.079,"z":0.833,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.328,"y":-0.624,"z":-0.24,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.804,"y":-0.534,"z":-0.418,"el":"C"},{"x":-5.5,"y":-1.76,"z":